<title>RUSSIA: Chapman Freeborn Russia becomes Delta cargo agent.</title>
<headline>Chapman Freeborn Russia becomes Delta cargo agent.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chapman Freeborn Russia freight-forward company has become a cargo agent of U.S. Delta Air Lines Inc in Russia, a forwarder said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Chapman Freeborn Russia senior manager Chris Lewis told Reuters that his company represented Delta export cargo operations. He gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
